<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:11:38Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Money, networks and bias: Why women struggle to win seats in US politics</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4cba876c77b22793b169edf120e41a967b055a8678c107d87e040c4c0bae2b4a</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:11:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T19:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/money-networks-and-bias-why-women-struggle-to-win-seats-in-us-politics/a-79625179--d768d0a80615.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/money-networks-and-bias-why-women-struggle-to-win-seats-in-us-politics/a-79625179?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US is holding Congress and state governors elections. At all levels of US politics, women are underrepresented — but they may win some historic victories in the midterms on November 3.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Eritrea urges UN deterrence measures against Ethiopia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fd0da6be2edc6671215936772137556d09ef280b86ce2999ca7193973687a74d</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:11:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T18:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eritrea-urges-un-deterrence-measures-against-ethiopia/a-79629670--3be24e605304.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eritrea-urges-un-deterrence-measures-against-ethiopia/a-79629670?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Eritrea has officially requested UN Security Council assistance over the conflict in Tigray. Both Eritrea and Ethiopia accuse each other of fueling regional instability.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump slams Zelenskyy, says Ukraine should elect new president</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d14cec3cd16819692957d4cb55a6b3697fc5adfbc9cc414b239cd1ab0b457739</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:11:34Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T17:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-slams-zelenskyy-says-ukraine-should-elect-new-president/a-79629740--e4368c941303.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-slams-zelenskyy-says-ukraine-should-elect-new-president/a-79629740?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">President Trump has criticized Volodymyr Zelenskyy for not making a deal with Russia to end the Ukraine war. Trump also warned Kyiv against targeting Russian oil refineries that will supply the US with diesel fuel.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Saudi Arabia suspends operations at Riyadh airport after an attack causes multiple injuries</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:11ab2caead3d99f334fb2e8efa4c5858add812f6b83e7ad6cd720db24a8de5e2</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:11:38Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T16:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-suspends-operations-at-riyadh-airport-after-an-attack-causes-multiple-injuries/a-79628862--bf78718db36b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-suspends-operations-at-riyadh-airport-after-an-attack-causes-multiple-injuries/a-79628862?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Riyadh's King Khalid International Airport has already been targeted multiple times this week amid intensified fighting between Yemen-based Houthi rebels and a Saudi-backed coalition.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Ragebait' is the 2026 German Youth Word of the Year</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0dd659ba3ca4b693024b410ed7f2f57dd95abed596f060646d4d58cc8fbf003e</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T13:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ragebait-is-the-2026-german-youth-word-of-the-year/a-79608158--c39c4c350c71.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ragebait-is-the-2026-german-youth-word-of-the-year/a-79608158?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Already named the 2025 Oxford Word of the Year, "rage bait" has also been widely adopted in German slang.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Germany sticks to Russia sanctions after Trump diesel deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0c31a926641534995806f2699d337c04638bdcea9f44a462decb45cbf8f5010f</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T13:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-sticks-to-russia-sanctions-after-trump-diesel-deal/live-79627811--7157e47a4e48.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-sticks-to-russia-sanctions-after-trump-diesel-deal/live-79627811?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After Washington announced a sanctions pause on Russian diesel, Germany has said it remains committed to pressuring Moscow and supporting Ukraine. More on DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Operations Plan Germany: How the Bundeswehr trains for NATO collective defense</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7f79ecd7ab251ca3cb4d7ff7d49afa8d8ae4192938a95788ad4433ed3bcc5233</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T12:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/operations-plan-germany-how-the-bundeswehr-trains-for-nato-collective-defense/a-79553793--d1447370a9ee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/operations-plan-germany-how-the-bundeswehr-trains-for-nato-collective-defense/a-79553793?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">How prepared is Germany for national defense? The answer lies in the Operations Plan Germany. Military exercises such as "Red Storm Charlie" are designed to put these preparations to the test in realistic scenarios.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Taiwan to boost military spending to 'deter war' with China</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:37434c7386b45a044c0b4513167e4422b1bde973285cedc32186f42b52d9c2c1</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T09:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/taiwan-to-boost-military-spending-to-deter-war-with-china/a-79625346--c901f81fd042.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/taiwan-to-boost-military-spending-to-deter-war-with-china/a-79625346?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">President Lai Ching-te ⁠said in a National Day speech that his country is boosting defense spending to 'deter war' with China. It comes after US President Donald Trump asked Taiwan to pay for US protection.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Is China seeking to restrict Taiwan's cultural presence?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4c85ca87514ba109456523c61f76ca175a0fcd7063ee7019ab26470adc8949cf</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T06:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/is-china-seeking-to-restrict-taiwan-s-cultural-presence/a-79610947--71784c91bb83.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/is-china-seeking-to-restrict-taiwan-s-cultural-presence/a-79610947?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From coffee competitions to literature awards, Beijing appears to be working to limit Taiwan's international cultural and political impact.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>How the Houthi-Saudi conflict is affecting countries on Africa's Red Sea coast — and beyond</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:34b3e8a704929e959738a946c436eab68453c09f57ea27ed50825b2fe9be716f</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T06:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-the-houthi-saudi-conflict-is-affecting-countries-on-africa-s-red-sea-coast-and-beyond/a-79588992--cc6ed789d367.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-the-houthi-saudi-conflict-is-affecting-countries-on-africa-s-red-sea-coast-and-beyond/a-79588992?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Bab el-Mandeb Strait, which Yemeni government forces are trying to take back from the Houthis, is located not far from Djibouti and other African states.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Indian authorities crack down on 'Cockroach' protest in central Delhi. Follow live.</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ba7d76ba056a2a48111f89fce6b488046dd543aa675ffd85f0be61554c2026d3</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T03:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/indian-authorities-crack-down-on-cockroach-protest-in-central-delhi-follow-live/live-79624339--672f535b5cb8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/indian-authorities-crack-down-on-cockroach-protest-in-central-delhi-follow-live/live-79624339?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Indian authorities have imposed extraordinary security measures to block protesters from joining a demonstration called by the Cockroach Janta Party in New Delhi. The main leaders of the party have been detained too.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Hurricane Isaias makes landfall in Florida</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:55c8c6d98235916007a130feffd513b667966702ac5baac36198df162625feab</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T02:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hurricane-isaias-makes-landfall-in-florida/a-79624148--25858d7eacee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hurricane-isaias-makes-landfall-in-florida/a-79624148?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US weather authorities are warning of "life-threatening" storm surges on the Gulf Coast due to the Category 2 hurricane. Extreme winds, rising water levels and possible tornadoes are also on the radar.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Mexico: Court finds three men guilty of murder of Australian, US surfers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2d40019402f252eb4ff32868285b7f3d8bd1072ffc5b3a41d630a72337575a1e</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T02:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/mexico-court-finds-three-men-guilty-of-murder-of-australian-us-surfers/a-79624125--635522eb3b29.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mexico-court-finds-three-men-guilty-of-murder-of-australian-us-surfers/a-79624125?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The 2024 murders of brothers Jake and Callum Robinson, along with their friend Carter Rhoad, shocked Mexico and drew international outrage.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump weighs livestream execution amid bipartisan backlash</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:294c94c1109cf253af4aee384ed006f5e9ca2ddf839df20943ff29a45d6930f7</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T01:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-weighs-livestream-execution-amid-bipartisan-backlash/a-79623920--91b5d9f7318c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-weighs-livestream-execution-amid-bipartisan-backlash/a-79623920?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump said he hasn't decided whether the execution of the Fort Hood shooter will be livestreamed, after the Pentagon announced it would do so. The plan has been criticized by both Republicans and Democrats.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump names new press secretary to succeed Karoline Leavitt</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:68b519a891ef80c0cd17ab34cc27ca8f1d5db151c11dc6d18d8cb929870f6578</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T23:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-names-new-press-secretary-to-succeed-karoline-leavitt/a-79623824--629248a0a121.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-names-new-press-secretary-to-succeed-karoline-leavitt/a-79623824?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Trump has appointed Katie Zacharia to take over the White House press secretary role vacated by Karoline Leavitt. She assumes the role with Trump struggling with low approval ratings driven by the US war with Iran.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Schools crisis in France: Investment fails to inspire confidence</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:36fcb61c9ed3fd900cb54d62408af9c5dc6cb76e2cddab70dffac7d07386d251</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T19:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/schools-crisis-in-france-investment-fails-to-inspire-confidence/a-79621916--f1c3b3d7b3e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/schools-crisis-in-france-investment-fails-to-inspire-confidence/a-79621916?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For weeks, schoolchildren in France have been protesting the failing education system. Compared to many other countries, France invests heavily in education but critics say that the funds are not distributed fairly.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Trump, Putin agree on deal to release Russian diesel to US, world markets</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:22106569e529c5e69c1f5b2b446688f5a34a23c2d18a9f57263c788194fca4fd</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T19:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-putin-agree-on-deal-to-release-russian-diesel-to-us-world-markets/a-79623364--6918b88c767f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-putin-agree-on-deal-to-release-russian-diesel-to-us-world-markets/a-79623364?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russia will supply diesel to global markets in a bid to lower prices, US President Donald Trump has said. The move reverses years of pressure on the Russian economy following the invasion of Ukraine.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Strong earthquakes shake Panama, buildings damaged</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4b192dca62015143798df4b43dbecdcf0b93ef6a88a8a8558c90073899eb0be1</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T19:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/strong-earthquakes-shake-panama-buildings-damaged/a-79623168--4ccbc69a74c2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/strong-earthquakes-shake-panama-buildings-damaged/a-79623168?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Panama's president has declared a "major disaster" after a series of tremors damaged buildings, briefly suspended flights and triggered a tsunami alert in Central and South America.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UAE: Omani Flydubai co-pilot planned suicide attack</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:23f41494b722b75bcf3d633a01ef08bcb0390a33b63593847790cfb7fa677612</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T18:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uae-omani-flydubai-co-pilot-planned-suicide-attack/a-79621960--511be6a0f4f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uae-omani-flydubai-co-pilot-planned-suicide-attack/a-79621960?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Flydubai co-pilot planned to crash a Dubai-Tel Aviv flight into the terminal at Israel's Ben Gurion Airport, according to a UAE official.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>China, EU reach deal to 'moderate' China's car exports to EU</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:73e17a8fffecc6331c555d8fc264026dc4a6def618e172c26705af03c92be32b</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T17:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-eu-reach-deal-to-moderate-china-s-car-exports-to-eu/a-79621394--639e99c9fdca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-eu-reach-deal-to-moderate-china-s-car-exports-to-eu/a-79621394?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">An agreement between the EU and China would reduce exports of Chinese electric and plug-in hybrid cars to the 27-member European bloc by up to 50%, according to the EU trade envoy.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Brussels: Rioters clash with police at anti-austerity rally</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b0e7d230ef49ed24712db2b4043461a227ac4010cb895da33123762a6fd6c0c5</id><updated>2026-10-10T20:10:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T15:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brussels-rioters-clash-with-police-at-anti-austerity-rally/a-79620594--e6d624f04684.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brussels-rioters-clash-with-police-at-anti-austerity-rally/a-79620594?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Violent rioters, many of whom were masked, confronted police at the edge of an anti-austerity march in Brussels. Police responded with water cannons and tear gas.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
